        {
          "id": 2151050022,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "@MathisMARION: This change invalidated the calculation, as is unclearly stated but can be derived from RFC6550 section 8.3.1 and section 17.\n```suggestion:-0+0\n                proto_item_append_text(pi, \" (Imax=%.0fms)\", (pow(2, tvb_get_uint8(tvb, opt_offset + 1)) * (1ULL << tvb_get_uint8(tvb, opt_offset))));\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 2398962,
            "username": "JaapKeuter",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jaap Keuter",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/722b0c520542a23cb8f8ea7070a45c88f9e9214dc700ac151e419e9649e0304e?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/JaapKeuter"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-10-09T18:56:17.160Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-09T21:16:42.775Z",
