        {
          "id": 2159600409,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Can you give an example of 2 values for `DIOIntervalDoublings` and `DIOIntervalMin` where the new computation is wrong?\n\nMathematically speaking we have `pow(2, x) == (1ull << x)` and also `pow(2, x) * pow(2, y) == pow(2, x + y)` so I do not see an issue here, unless you are referring to rounding or overflow issues.",
